Given area = perimeter.

Set up equation: 3x(x +5) = 8x +10.

Solve for x.

3x(x+5) = 3x^2 +15x = 8x +10 => 3x^2 +15x -8x -10 =0 => 3x^2 +7x -10 =0.

Solve quadratic: 3x^2 +7x -10=0.

